              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.13.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 13:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ale muleeteku mu bwidhuvu ebintu byonabyona ebiva mu kintu ekirala ekirala ku buli bintu eikumi bye mufuna, mwidhuze eiterekero ly'eisinzizo lyange libeemu emere kamaala. Mugezeeku mube ng'abali kundeba, mubone oba nga tiribaiguliragho igulu ni mbadhogomolera bintu birungi kamaala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiriganha bisiisa kuzikiriza birime byaimwe. N'emizabbibu gyaimwe tigiriroba kubala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo abantu b'omu maghanga goonagoona balibeetanga ab'enkabi, kuba ensi yaimwe eriba yeesiimisa okubaamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
